BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:sale-11754-20261119@port-murray
DTSTAMP:20261112T234547Z
SUMMARY:Elegant Estates: A Selling Exhibition
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261119T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261119T180000
LOCATION:Morristown\, NJ 07960
DESCRIPTION:Elegant Estates: A Selling Exhibition\nbrings together an exce
 ptional and eclectic selection of property from multiple estates\, though
 tfully assembled under one roof at our Morristown\, New Jersey gallery. S
 panning fine art\, antiques\, modern furniture\, decorative arts\, jewelr
 y\, and distinctive collectibles\, the exhibition offers visitors the opp
 ortunity to explore an extensive range of objects across a variety of col
 lecting categories.\nHighlights include original and limited-edition work
 s by Salvador Dalí\, Erté\, Bernard Buffet\, Henry Gasser\, LeBaDang\, 
 James Carlin\, and others\; modern furniture by designers and makers incl
 uding Ib Kofod-Larsen\, Leon Rosen for Pace\, and Formations\; and bronze
  sculpture by Giorgio Zennaro and Nathaniel Kaz. The selection also featu
 res sterling silver by Tiffany & Co.\, Cartier\, and Reed & Barton\; art 
 glass by Baccarat and Steuben\; name-brand fashion and handbags\; and hun
 dreds of American and foreign silver coins and commemoratives.\nAdditiona
 l offerings include gold and fashion jewelry\, modern\, Asian\, and Tiffa
 ny-style lighting\, English\, French\, Italian\, and Japanese porcelain a
 nd china\, antique maps\, and a wide assortment of antiques and collectib
 les.\nWith such a broad range of property assembled in one location\, thi
 s selling exhibition offers something of interest to collectors\, decorat
 ors\, and shoppers alike.
URL:https://www.estatesales.net/NJ/Morristown/07960/5138073
END:VEVENT
